This Ruth[ Be]echick title for beginning grades is recommended widely — from The[ Well]-Trained Mind to Sonlight. Typically packaged as part of The Three Rs, A Strong Start in Language helps you become the editor from the beginning — from the time your child traces his[ first] letters, to copywork, and through dictation. Read our full review (scroll down).
