> [A]thlone Community Radio will be broadcasting live for 4 hours from Golden Island Shopping Centre in Ath[lone], the heart of Ireland, to Celebr[ate] World Radio Day 2019. Our[ live] broadcast will begin at 12pm and finish at 4pm. The Theme of World Radio Day is “Dialogue, Tolerance and Peace”.
