• The power supply (approx. 6 bars) disconnects the[ to]othed clutch.
• The transmission (8) makes it easy to assemble the[ to]othed clutch and add a crown wheel or pulley, etc.
• Static moments (MS) from 110 to 2100[ N]m.[]

